---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---

<!-- City Hero Section -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <!-- Badges Top (Matching furnace repair pros) -->
      <div class="hero-badges-top">
        <span class="hero-pill-active"><span class="badge-dot"></span> Priority Roofing Network Active</span>
        <span class="hero-pill-fast">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
          FAST ROOFING SERVICE IN {{ city.name | upper }}, {{ city.stateAbbr }}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1>Shingle Installation in {{ city.name }}, {{ city.stateAbbr }}</h1>

      <!-- Rich Niche Paragraph (Matching furnace repair pros depth) -->
      <p class="hero-lead">
        American Shingle Co. provides homeowners in {{ city.name }} with licensed and insured roofing specialists who arrive fully equipped to inspect deck integrity, manage complete tear-offs, and install precision architectural, metal, and composite shingles on schedule. We provide rapid dispatch with typical contractor response times of 30 to 90 minutes &mdash; code-compliant installation, verified contractor credentials, and guaranteed structural protection.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-trust-pills">
        <span class="trust-pill"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg> {{ city.county }}</span>
        <span class="trust-pill"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg> Median Home Built: {{ city.medianHomeAge }}</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Buttons (Matching furnace repair pros) -->
      <div class="hero-cta-group">
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}" class="hero-btn-call">
          <div class="hero-btn-call-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M6.62 10.79a15.053 15.053 0 006.59 6.59l2.2-2.2c.27-.27.67-.36 1.02-.24 1.12.37 2.33.57 3.57.57.55 0 1 .45 1 1V20c0 .55-.45 1-1 1-9.39 0-17-7.61-17-17 0-.55.45-1 1-1h3.5c.55 0 1 .45 1 1 0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57.11.35.03.74-.25 1.02l-2.2 2.2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-btn-call-text">
            <span class="hero-btn-call-sub">CALL 24/7 INTAKE</span>
            <span class="hero-btn-call-num">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/states/{{ city.stateSlug }}/" class="hero-btn-outline">
          <span>{{ city.state }} Directory &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="hero-img-wrapper" style="position: relative;">
        <img src="/assets/images/hero_roofing.jpg" alt="Professional roofing contractor installing shingles in {{ city.name }}, {{ city.stateAbbr }}" class="hero-main-img" width="900" height="650">
        <div class="hero-img-badge">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg>
          <span>Response Time: 30 to 90 Mins</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Stats Ribbon below Hero (Matching furnace repair pros) -->
<div class="hero-stats-strip">
  <div class="container hero-stats-grid">
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">30 to 90 Min</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">Average Partner Response</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">Independent Contractors</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">All 7 Materials</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">Asphalt, Metal, Slate &amp; More</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat-item">
      <span class="hero-stat-value">Code Compliance</span>
      <span class="hero-stat-label">{{ city.permitDept }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Main City Body -->
<section style="padding: 3.5rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    
    <!-- Direct Answer Lead -->
    <div class="direct-answer">
      <strong>{{ city.name }} Roofing Overview:</strong> Homeowners in {{ city.name }} (population {{ city.population | formatNumber }}) face distinct weather demands with {{ city.hailRisk | lower }} hail exposure and {{ city.windRisk | lower }}. With a local median home construction year of {{ city.medianHomeAge }}, many roofs in {{ city.county }} have reached or exceeded their 20 to 25-year asphalt replacement cycle.
    </div>

    <!-- Local Roofing Guide -->
    <h2>Local Roofing Guide for {{ city.name }}, {{ city.state }}</h2>
    <p>
      Residential roofs in {{ city.name }} must be engineered to withstand regional climate patterns and comply with municipal building codes enforced by the <strong>{{ city.permitDept }}</strong>. Whether you are replacing weathered shingles or installing a new high-durability roofing system, our network connects you with licensed and insured local contractors who handle the complete scope of work:
    </p>

    <!-- 7 Services Cards in City -->
    <h2>Shingle Roofing Services Available in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    <div class="services-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem 0;">
      {% for s in services %}
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card-img-wrapper">
          <img src="{{ s.image }}" alt="{{ s.name }} in {{ city.name }}" loading="lazy" width="400" height="250" class="service-card-img">
        </div>
        <div class="service-card-body">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">
            {% if city.tier == 1 %}
            <a href="/{{ city.stateSlug }}/{{ city.slug }}/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }} in {{ city.name }}</a>
            {% else %}
            <a href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">{{ s.name }}</a>
            {% endif %}
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0.5rem 0;">{{ s.shortDescription }}</p>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-top: auto;">
            <span><strong>Lifespan:</strong> {{ s.lifespan }}</span>
            <span><strong>Wind:</strong> {{ s.windRating }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Building Codes & Permits Box -->
    <h2>Building Permits & Inspections in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    <div class="callout-box" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--color-secondary);">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Permit Jurisdiction: {{ city.permitDept }}</h3>
      <p>
        In {{ city.name }} and throughout {{ city.county }}, residential roof replacements involving a complete tear-off typically require a municipal building permit prior to beginning work. Independent contractors in our network pull required permits on your behalf, schedule necessary in-progress and final roof deck inspections, and ensure installation compliance with adopted building codes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Local Estimated Costs Table -->
    <h2>Estimated Shingle Roof Costs in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    <p>
      Cost ranges based on typical 2,000 square foot residential homes in {{ city.county }}, adjusted for regional labor and material indices:
    </p>

    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Shingle Material</th>
            <th>Cost Per Square Installed</th>
            <th>Estimated 2,000 Sq Ft Project</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Standard 3-Tab Asphalt</strong></td>
            <td>$350 – $450</td>
            <td>$7,000 – $9,000</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Architectural Asphalt Shingles</strong></td>
            <td>$430 – $590</td>
            <td>$8,600 – $11,800</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>UL 2218 Class 4 Impact Asphalt</strong></td>
            <td>$490 – $670</td>
            <td>$9,800 – $13,400</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Stone-Coated Metal Shingles</strong></td>
            <td>$860 – $1,420</td>
            <td>$17,200 – $28,400</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Recycled Rubber Shingles</strong></td>
            <td>$810 – $1,370</td>
            <td>$16,200 – $27,400</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Composite Synthetic Slate/Shake</strong></td>
            <td>$960 – $1,620</td>
            <td>$19,200 – $32,400</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Natural S1 Quarried Slate</strong></td>
            <td>$1,520 – $3,050+</td>
            <td>$30,400 – $61,000+</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- ZIP Codes Served -->
    <h2>ZIP Codes Served in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    <p>
      Our referral network covers all neighborhoods and properties within {{ city.name }}, including the following primary postal ZIP codes:
    </p>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin: 1rem 0 2rem 0;">
      {% for z in city.zips %}
      <span style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary);">
        {{ z }}
      </span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Also Serving Nearby Communities -->
    {% if city.nearbyCities and city.nearbyCities.length > 0 %}
    <h2>Also Serving Nearby Communities</h2>
    <p>We also connect homeowners with licensed roofing professionals in communities neighboring {{ city.name }}:</p>
    <div class="state-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      {% for n in city.nearbyCities %}
      <a href="/{{ n.stateSlug }}/{{ n.slug }}/" class="state-link">
        <span>{{ n.name }}, {{ city.stateAbbr }}</span>
        <span class="state-abbr">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <!-- Local FAQs -->
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions in {{ city.name }}</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">How much does a new shingle roof cost in {{ city.name }}?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>For an average 2,000 square foot single-family home in {{ city.name }}, architectural asphalt shingle installation generally costs between $8,600 and $11,800. Final project cost depends on roof slope pitch, number of old shingle layers to tear off, and condition of the underlying roof decking.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">How long does roof replacement take in {{ city.name }}?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>Most residential roof replacements in {{ city.name }} are completed in 1 to 2 days by an experienced 5-6 person crew, weather permitting. Complete cleanup with rolling magnetic sweeps is performed daily.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-summary">Are contractors in {{ city.name }} licensed and insured?</summary>
        <div class="faq-content">
          <p>Yes. All independent roofing contractors in the American Shingle Co. referral network must verify compliance with {{ city.state }} state and {{ city.county }} licensing, bonding, insurance, and municipal permit requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Final Call to Action -->
    <div style="background: var(--color-primary); color: #ffffff; padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0;">Request Your {{ city.name }} Roofing Estimate</h2>
      <p style="color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
        Speak directly with a roofing specialist serving {{ city.name }}. Average partner contractor response time is {{ site.responseTime }}.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size: 1.15rem; padding: 0.95rem 2rem;">
          Call (833) 348-0328
        </a>
        <a href="/states/{{ city.stateSlug }}/" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Browse {{ city.state }} Directory
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
